      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly having a custom cache for this would be great, my appdata is in my OS Drive which is a 128GB Solid State and vrchat frequently needs to get pruned. I'd much rather it go to one of my /three/ other drives with terabytes worth of data free in them.",
