      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 7
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As much as I hate necro-posting, this is something that NEEDS to be said.\n(In response to what Tupper said)\nWhether or not the cache is where it's \"supposed\" to be, it's not where it NEEDS to be. Do you know how often I come across people who don't even know how to clear their cache, let alone symlink? Hell, nearly all of them don't even know how to show hidden files and folders.\n\nWhat people REALLY want, is to have a choice in the matter. Default it to the appdata folder, sure, but allow those who don't know what the hell they're doing, to choose where the cache file is in an easy to use format.\n\nI can Symlink, that's no problem. We have a lot of people in the community though, who barely know how to even use a computer. Make it easier on them for crying out loud.\n\nEdit: Hell, there's more than 300 votes on this. Come on.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
