      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5cc5f2849a854f6ee61715ae",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I would like to say some people have a small SSD or hard drive and may want to save space on that hard drive for their OS for example, my PC has an SSD but the SSD is only meant for the operating system on my PC to load faster and I would prefer to switch the cache to go into my hard drive for example: C: drive = SSD hard drive = D",
