  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-04-08T15:25:03.411Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Can we move the cache out of AppData please? I don't need 10GB+ of maps on my OS drive...\n\nPerhaps use the installation directory or a custom location set by the user. And a \"Prune Map Data\" button in system would be great.",
